    description: "STATEMENT\nA PHP call to a function through its fully qualified name (`\\Util\\helper();`) has a call edge: to the function when the repository declares it, unresolved otherwise.\n\nOBSERVED (2026-11-25, the call-resolution fixture, column `qual`, both layouts, every arm)\n`function via_qual() { \\Util\\helper(); }` with `namespace Util; function helper() { return 1; }` in util.php: no outgoing call edge of any kind from via_qual (cell `no_edge`). The same file's `use function Util\\helper; helper();` (column `import`) does get an edge.\nReproduce: python packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/tests/_call_matrix_fixture.py php\nPinned as `no_edge` in test_call_resolution_matrix.py (MATRIX and MATRIX_SPLIT, php, last cell). Not investigated: whether the qualified-name node is not visited or the callee text is dropped."  # d131
    fields: {}  # d131
